From 1cdf9d0f16cb71ed0784082f2f6512685ec879cf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GuaiYiHu <guaiyihu@foxmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 06:17:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: Initialize LE capabilities only for capable
 Android 15 controllers

Adapt the MiOne classic-only controller fix to Android 15 GD APIs and channel sounding. Wait for BR/EDR features before LE discovery, synchronize the LE supported-state callback before reading LE feature-dependent capabilities, and retain SSP setup for classic controllers. Query event mask page 2 only when the controller reports the command.

Adapted-from: 0c72713d86013fcc12c03c57f522b42c375950bc
Change-Id: I704a6edec2eb5e028bdf52a44c8114c49609b6a6
---
 system/gd/hci/controller.cc | 236 +++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 124 insertions(+), 112 deletions(-)

diff --git a/system/gd/hci/controller.cc b/system/gd/hci/controller.cc
index 925f1cc787..366b7b5ba3 100644
